    // Dst Domain:
    //   - `dst_count`: 0, 1, 2. (Can be derived from `src_count` sync or maintained independently).
    //   - `dst_wp`: Synchronized `src_wp`.
    //   - On read: If `dst_count` > 0 and `dst_ready_i`:
