    //   - If src_valid_synced_2 && dst_count < 2:
    //       - `dst_count` <= `dst_count` + 1;
    //       - `dst_wp` <= (`dst_wp` + 1) % 2;
    //       - `data[dst_wp]` <= `src_data_i` (Wait, we can't write to data in Dst domain if it's not synchronized? No, the data is written in Src domain).
